  "caption": "Across two hypotheses, that structural switch cascades through two organellar choke points. Under H2, impaired NHE6 proton-leak regulation traps surface ApoER2 and LRP1 receptors inside early endosomes. Under H5, ABCA1 and NPC1 lipid-export bottlenecks sequester unesterified cholesterol in lysosomes, raising lysosomal pH and blunting beta-amyloid clearance.",
